      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence1-13",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "父懋，光祿大夫、南鄉僖侯。",
        "reading": "父王懋官光祿大夫、南鄉僖侯。",
        "note": "父王懋官光祿大夫、南鄉僖侯。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 13,
        "end_codepoint": 26,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence2-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "瑩選尚宋臨淮公主，拜駙馬都尉，除著作佐郎，累遷太子舍人，撫軍功曹，散騎侍郎，司徒左西屬。",
        "reading": "尚宋臨淮公主，拜駙馬都尉後歷著作佐郎等官。",
        "note": "尚宋臨淮公主，拜駙馬都尉後歷著作佐郎等官。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 44,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "齊高帝爲驃騎將軍，引爲從事中郎。",
        "reading": "齊高帝為驃騎，辟瑩為從事中郎。",
        "note": "齊高帝為驃騎，辟瑩為從事中郎。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 16,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-16",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "頃之，出爲義興太守，代謝超宗。",
        "reading": "瑩出義興，代謝超宗。",
        "note": "瑩出義興，代謝超宗。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 16,
        "end_codepoint": 31,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-31",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "超宗去郡，與瑩交惡，旣還，間瑩於懋。",
        "reading": "超宗去任，構瑩於其父懋。",
        "note": "超宗去任，構瑩於其父懋。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 31,
        "end_codepoint": 49,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-49",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "懋言之於朝廷，以瑩供養不足，坐失郡廢棄。",
        "reading": "懋告朝廷供養不足，瑩失郡。",
        "note": "懋告朝廷供養不足，瑩失郡。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 49,
        "end_codepoint": 69,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-69",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "久之，爲前軍諮議參軍，中書侍郎，大司馬從事中郎，未拜，丁母憂。",
        "reading": "後歷前軍諮議、中書等，未拜時遭母喪。",
        "note": "後歷前軍諮議、中書等，未拜時遭母喪。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 69,
        "end_codepoint": 100,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-100",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "服闋，爲給事黃門郎，出爲宣城太守，遷爲驃騎長史。",
        "reading": "服闋後歷黃門、宣城、驃騎長史。",
        "note": "服闋後歷黃門、宣城、驃騎長史。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 100,
        "end_codepoint": 124,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-124",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "復爲黃門侍郎、司馬、太子中庶子，仍遷侍中，父憂去職。",
        "reading": "又歷黃門侍郎等，自侍中因父喪去職。",
        "note": "又歷黃門侍郎等，自侍中因父喪去職。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 124,
        "end_codepoint": 150,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-150",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "服闋，復爲侍中，領射聲校尉，又爲冠軍將軍、東陽太守。",
        "reading": "服闋復侍中，領射聲校尉，出東陽。",
        "note": "服闋復侍中，領射聲校尉，出東陽。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 150,
        "end_codepoint": 176,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-176",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "居郡有惠政，遷吳興太守。",
        "reading": "東陽有惠政，遷吳興。",
        "note": "東陽有惠政，遷吳興。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 176,
        "end_codepoint": 188,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-188",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "明帝勤憂庶政，瑩頻處二郡，皆有能名。",
        "reading": "明帝時兩郡皆有能名。",
        "note": "明帝時兩郡皆有能名。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 188,
        "end_codepoint": 206,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-206",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "甚見褒美。",
        "reading": "受褒。",
        "note": "受褒。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 206,
        "end_codepoint": 211,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence3-211",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "還爲太子詹事、中領軍。",
        "reading": "還朝任太子詹事、中領軍。",
        "note": "還朝任太子詹事、中領軍。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 211,
        "end_codepoint": 222,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "永元初，政由羣小，瑩守職而不能有所是非。",
        "reading": "永元初守職，未置可否。",
        "note": "永元初守職，未置可否。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 20,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-20",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "瑩從弟亮旣當朝，於瑩素雖不善，時欲引與同事。",
        "reading": "亮為瑩從弟，雖不素善而欲引共事。",
        "note": "亮為瑩從弟，雖不素善而欲引共事。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 20,
        "end_codepoint": 42,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-42",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "遷尚書左僕射，未拜。",
        "reading": "第一次除尚書左僕射未拜。",
        "note": "第一次除尚書左僕射未拜。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 42,
        "end_codepoint": 52,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-52",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "會護軍崔慧景自京口奉江夏王入伐，瑩假節，率衆拒慧景於湖頭，夜爲慧景所襲，衆散，瑩赴水，乘榜入樂遊，因得還臺城。",
        "reading": "崔慧景奉江夏王來，瑩兵敗還臺。",
        "note": "崔慧景奉江夏王來，瑩兵敗還臺。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 52,
        "end_codepoint": 107,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-107",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "慧景敗，還居領軍府。",
        "reading": "慧景敗後瑩回領軍府。",
        "note": "慧景敗後瑩回領軍府。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 107,
        "end_codepoint": 117,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-117",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "義師至，復假節，都督宮城諸軍事。",
        "reading": "義師至，假節督宮城。",
        "note": "義師至，假節督宮城。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 117,
        "end_codepoint": 133,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-133",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "建康平，高祖爲相國，引瑩爲左長史，加冠軍將軍，奉法駕迎和帝于江陵。",
        "reading": "梁高祖為相，引瑩左長史，奉法駕迎齊和帝。",
        "note": "梁高祖為相，引瑩左長史，奉法駕迎齊和帝。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 133,
        "end_codepoint": 166,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-166",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "帝至南州，遜位于別宮。",
        "reading": "此帝為齊和帝，至南州遜位。",
        "note": "此帝為齊和帝，至南州遜位。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 166,
        "end_codepoint": 177,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-177",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "高祖踐阼，遷侍中、撫軍將軍，封建城縣公，邑千戶。",
        "reading": "梁武帝即位，瑩封建城縣公、千戶。",
        "note": "梁武帝即位，瑩封建城縣公、千戶。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 177,
        "end_codepoint": 201,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-201",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "尋遷尚書左僕射，侍中、撫軍如故。",
        "reading": "遷尚書左僕射，餘官如故。",
        "note": "遷尚書左僕射，餘官如故。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 201,
        "end_codepoint": 217,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-217",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "頃之，爲護軍將軍，復遷散騎常侍、中軍將軍、丹陽尹。",
        "reading": "後歷護軍、中軍、丹楊尹。",
        "note": "後歷護軍、中軍、丹楊尹。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 217,
        "end_codepoint": 242,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-242",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "視事三年，遷侍中、光祿大夫，領左衛將軍。",
        "reading": "視事三年後領左衛等。",
        "note": "視事三年後領左衛等。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 242,
        "end_codepoint": 262,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-262",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "俄遷尚書令、雲麾將軍，侍中如故。",
        "reading": "遷尚書令、雲麾。",
        "note": "遷尚書令、雲麾。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 262,
        "end_codepoint": 278,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-278",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "累進號左中權將軍，給鼓吹一部。",
        "reading": "進左中權將軍，給鼓吹一部。",
        "note": "進左中權將軍，給鼓吹一部。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 278,
        "end_codepoint": 293,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence4-293",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "瑩性清慎，居官恭恪，高祖深重之。",
        "reading": "以清慎恭恪受高祖重。",
        "note": "以清慎恭恪受高祖重。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 293,
        "end_codepoint": 309,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence5-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "天監十五年，遷左光祿大夫、開府儀同三司，丹陽尹、侍中如故。",
        "reading": "天監十五年遷左光祿、開府，丹陽尹、侍中仍舊。",
        "note": "天監十五年遷左光祿、開府，丹陽尹、侍中仍舊。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 29,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence5-29",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "瑩將拜，印工鑄其印，六鑄而龜六毀，旣成，頸空不實，補而用之。",
        "reading": "將拜前六次鑄印，龜鈕均毀；成後補其頸。",
        "note": "將拜前六次鑄印，龜鈕均毀；成後補其頸。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 29,
        "end_codepoint": 59,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence5-59",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "居職六日，暴疾卒。",
        "reading": "居職六日暴病卒，六日是任職時長。",
        "note": "居職六日暴病卒，六日是任職時長。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 59,
        "end_codepoint": 68,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-016-wangying:received_sentence5-68",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABCA",
        "source_quote": "贈侍中、左光祿大夫、開府儀同三司。",
        "reading": "卒後贈侍中、左光祿、開府。",
